deps>0 rows:
rosett-ai | Hugo Antonio Sepulveda Manriquez | deps=17 | 'Configuration management tool for AI-assisted development workflows. Author rules once, compile to Claude Code, Cursor, AGENTS.md, and more.'
edoxen | Ribose Inc. | deps=5 | 'Edoxen provides a Ruby library for working with a generic meeting/decision model, allowing users to create, manipulate, and serialize meeting, agenda, motion, voting, and decision data in a structured format. Built on top of the lutaml-model serialization framework, with profile-based customization (ISO 8601-2 §15) for domain-specific extensions. '
sportdb-parser | Gerald Bauer | deps=1 | 'fbtxt-parser - football.txt match parser (& tokenizer)'
apex_self_ssrf | testingbear | deps=1 | 'Testing dependency resolution'
apex_dep_test | testingbear | deps=1 | 'Testing dependency resolution'
xss-dep-test | Testing Buffalo | deps=1 | "'== Dependency Test Gem "
jrjackson | Guy Boertje | deps=1 | 'A mostly native JRuby wrapper for the java jackson json processor jar'
shirobai | fusagiko / takayamaki | deps=1 | 'Drop-in Rust replacement for heavy RuboCop cops'
shirobai-performance | fusagiko / takayamaki | deps=2 | 'Drop-in Rust replacement for rubocop-performance cops'
shirobai-rspec | fusagiko / takayamaki | deps=2 | 'Drop-in Rust replacement for rubocop-rspec cops'
shirobai-rails | fusagiko / takayamaki | deps=2 | 'Drop-in Rust replacement for rubocop-rails cops'
rubocop-metz | Salvador Fuentes Jr | deps=3 | 'A RuboCop plugin that ships custom cops capturing Sandi-Metz-style design heuristics for Ruby and Rails code.'
metz-scan | Salvador Fuentes Jr | deps=1 | 'metz-scan is the user-facing CLI for the Sandi-Metz-inspired code-quality toolchain. It runs RuboCop with the rubocop-metz plugin and renders developer-friendly reports.'
klondikemarlen-jira-api | Marlen Brunner | deps=4 | 'Provides Jira Cloud comment CRUD, converts Markdown to Atlassian Document Format, and optionally uploads allowed remote images as Jira issue attachments.'
marlens-jira-api | Marlen Brunner | deps=4 | 'Provides Jira Cloud comment CRUD, converts Markdown to Atlassian Document Format, and optionally uploads allowed remote images as Jira issue attachments.'
ecoportal-api-graphql | Oscar Segura | deps=3 | 'A collection of helpers for interacting with the ecoPortal GraphQL API'
eco-helpers | Oscar Segura | deps=22 | 'eco-helpers to manage people api cases'
rails-agent-stack | Tiny Bubble Company | deps=3 | 'Rails Agents (gem: rails-agent-stack) is the simplest way to build AI agents in Ruby on Rails. Define an LLM agent as a plain Ruby class, attach your app code as tools, add skills like web search or spreadsheets, and call .run — minutes to production, not days of framework setup. Built for developers searching for Rails AI agents, Ruby LLM agents, OpenAI / Anthropic / Claude / GPT tool-calling agents, OpenRouter and Grok (xAI) integrations, agentic workflows, RAG helpers, and a lighter alternati'
pico_phone | Gabi Jack | deps=1 | "pico_phone wraps Google's libphonenumber C++ library via a Rice native extension, providing phone number parsing, validation, and formatting for any country. It uses the same engine as Android's dialer and delivers native C++ performance for high-throughput server-side use."
minitest-hashdiff | Lachlan Young | deps=1 | 'When assert_equal fails on two hashes, show exactly what changed: added, removed, and changed keys with type-change detection (nil to String, Integer to Float, symbol vs string keys), instead of two walls of inspect output. Zero configuration, Minitest loads it automatically. From the maker of rubyhash.dev.'
intranet-pictures | Ebling Mis | deps=2 | 'Pictures gallery module for the intranet.'
query-stream | Atelier Mirai | deps=2 | 'A generic Ruby library that expands QueryStream notation in text content by combining YAML/JSON data files with template files.'
talk_to_your_app | Igor | deps=3 | 'A thin Rails layer over the official MCP Ruby SDK. Mounts a Streamable HTTP MCP endpoint, gates access behind API-key or HTTP Basic auth, enforces fail-closed per-tool database roles, and ships five bundled plugins (DB, Jobs, Flipper, Rake, Custom Tools) plus a Ruby DSL for writing your own. '
hyper-quick-kit | Prvaz12_mars | deps=2 | 'Research based on cuba'

